# Repository Classifier

## Purpose

Convert one bounded `repository-brief` context into a proposed Repository Brief.
Return JSON conforming to the adjacent `repository-brief.schema.json`; return no
prose outside it.

## Allowed input

- Snapshot ID and file inventory.
- Hash-verified documentation and manifests.
- Module/package inventory.
- Function, class, and method inventory with source spans.
- Import relationships and their evidence.

Do not read arbitrary repository files. Symbol existence and signatures do not prove
runtime behavior.

## Required work

1. Describe repository purpose using documentation evidence.
2. Identify technologies using manifests and indexed languages.
3. Propose only components supported by module membership and imports.
4. Recommend a short reading order using known files/modules.
5. Record missing entry-point and call-flow evidence as unknowns.

## Output constraints

- Use `brief_version: "0.1"` and copy the input snapshot ID exactly.
- Use evidence IDs shaped as `file:<path>`, `module:<name>`,
  `function:<qualified-name>`, `class:<qualified-name>`,
  `method:<qualified-name>`, and `import:<source>-><target>`.
- Leave `entry_points` and `flows` empty unless deterministic evidence supports them.
- Keep confidence between 0 and 1.
- Prefer a supported unknown over an attractive guess.
{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://github.com/yuvalkenneth/LogicLens/repository-brief.schema.json",
  "title": "LogicLens Repository Brief 0.1",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "brief_version",
    "snapshot_id",
    "purpose",
    "technologies",
    "components",
    "entry_points",
    "flows",
    "reading_order",
    "unknowns"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "brief_version": {"const": "0.1"},
    "snapshot_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
    "purpose": {"$ref": "#/$defs/purpose"},
    "technologies": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/technology"}},
    "components": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/component"}},
    "entry_points": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/entryPoint"}},
    "flows": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/flow"}},
    "reading_order": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/readingItem"}},
    "unknowns": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}}
  },
  "$defs": {
    "evidence": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "items": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}
    },
    "purpose": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["summary", "evidence", "confidence"],
      "properties": {
        "summary": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
        "evidence": {"$ref": "#/$defs/evidence"},
        "confidence": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 1}
      }
    },
    "technology": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["name", "role", "evidence"],
      "properties": {
        "name": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
        "role": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
        "evidence": {"$ref": "#/$defs/evidence"}
      }
    },
    "component": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["name", "members", "reason", "evidence"],
      "properties": {
        "name": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
        "members": {"type": "array", "minItems": 1, "items": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}},
        "reason": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
        "evidence": {"$ref": "#/$defs/evidence"}
      }
    },
    "entryPoint": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["target", "status", "reason", "evidence"],
      "properties": {
        "target": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
        "status": {"enum": ["candidate", "confirmed"]},
        "reason": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
        "evidence": {"$ref": "#/$defs/evidence"}
      }
    },
    "flow": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["name", "steps", "reason", "evidence"],
      "properties": {
        "name": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
        "steps": {"type": "array", "minItems": 1, "items": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}},
        "reason": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
        "evidence": {"$ref": "#/$defs/evidence"}
      }
    },
    "readingItem": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["target", "reason"],
      "properties": {
        "target": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
        "reason": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}
      }
    }
  }
}
